  contactDamage: 1
  description: A pale worm that has never hurried and never let go. Its bolt remembers
    you longer than most friendships last.
  tactics: Its slow red bolt hunts for over TWO seconds - you cannot simply sidestep
    it once. Drag it in a wide circle until it dies of old age, and mind the wave
    around you while you babysit it. Kill the Lamprey first when possible.
